    "name": "IShardSetConnectionsConfiguration",
    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "csharp",
    "contract": "IShardSetConnectionsConfiguration lets provider-specific consumers read a shard set name, its default shard identifier, the shard configurations in that set, and separately addressable read and write connection configurations. Implementers permit the shard set name and default shard identifier to be updated."
